/T (Testing in the Developer Edition environment confirmed record creation, record retrieval by Parcel ID, merge-tag resolution, and flow output assignment for the test record P-001 \(Laptop, status Booked, weight 2 kg, estimated delivery 10/17/2026\). The report also records the observations made during testing, including a preview-stage finding that the agent must be bound to the custom parcel action before it can answer from Parcel__c data, and sets out a roadmap covering telematics, omnichannel notifications, a customer portal, and multi-carrier integration.)
