/T (First, a Decision element after Get Records should test whether a record was found; if not, the flow assigns a fixed message such as "No parcel found for the supplied ID" to Output and ends, which implements the "no match" handling expected by TC-08. Second, the Action element should have a Fault connector that assigns a safe error message and logs the fault so that a prompt or permission failure never surfaces as a raw platform error.)
/E (First, a Decision element after Get Records should test whether a record was found; if not, the flow assigns a fixed message such as "No parcel found for the supplied ID" to Output and ends, which implements the "no match" handling expected by TC-08. Second, the Action element should have a Fault connector that assigns a safe error message and logs the fault so that a prompt or permission failure never surfaces as a raw platform error.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [51]
>>
