/T (Exposing CRM records to AI integration layers or multi-tiered user groups without least-privilege governance risks data leakage, unauthorised record editing, and improper exposure of personally identifiable information \(PII\). SwiftShip Tracker addresses these risks using a multi-layered security model. Organisational access boundaries are governed by a defined Role Hierarchy:)
/E (Exposing CRM records to AI integration layers or multi-tiered user groups without least-privilege governance risks data leakage, unauthorised record editing, and improper exposure of personally identifiable information \(PII\). SwiftShip Tracker addresses these risks using a multi-layered security model. Organisational access boundaries are governed by a defined Role Hierarchy:)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1275 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 221 0 R
/T (To ensure automated components respect these boundaries, flows are governed via explicit permission set configuration. A custom "Swift Ship" Permission Set was created to control access to automation assets and object permissions. Within it, Flow Access explicitly enables execution rights for the Parcel Details flow for authorised roles and background AI users, while restricting unauthorised execution across standard user profiles.)
/E (To ensure automated components respect these boundaries, flows are governed via explicit permission set configuration. A custom "Swift Ship" Permission Set was created to control access to automation assets and object permissions. Within it, Flow Access explicitly enables execution rights for the Parcel Details flow for authorised roles and background AI users, while restricting unauthorised execution across standard user profiles.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [7]
>>
