/Title (telephone queues, and standalone software. This fragmentation slows support teams, increases data-entry errors, and erodes customer trust. This report documents SwiftShip Tracker, an AI-enabled parcel management prototype built on the Salesforce Developer Edition platform as an academic project in the Department of Computer Science and Engineering.)
