2991 0 obj
<<
/Title (mechanisms into a unified Customer Relationship Management \(CRM\) architecture is critical for operational efficiency, data integrity, and customer retention. Logistics enterprises frequently operate across disparate operational silos, where booking details, transit milestones, sender/receiver profiles, and delivery status updates reside in disconnected software applications or unindexed spreadsheets. Unifying these mechanisms within an enterprise CRM platform establishes a definitive single source of truth. This centralised architecture provides real-time operational visibility across the complete parcel lifecycle, eliminates manual administrative overhead, accelerates support desk response times, and builds a foundation for scalable workflow automation and generative artificial intelligence.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2415 0 R
/Prev 2763 0 R
/Next 3215 0 R
>>
endobj
