/Title (index, so lookup time stays small as record counts grow. The main latency contributor is the generative step: the prompt preview recorded 1.41 seconds for 525 tokens. This is suitable for conversational use but is not "sub-second"; the non-functional target in Chapter 2 should be restated as a response time of a few seconds for the AI step, with the data lookup itself completing in milliseconds. For scale, bulk-safe Apex, selective queries, and avoiding DML in the tracking path keep the design within governor limits.)
/Dest [46 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3440 0 R
/Prev 3457 0 R
>>
