/Title (When a user submits an unstructured inquiry such as "Track parcel P-001", the Agentforce reasoning engine executes a structured cycle: \(1\) NLP parses the intent and isolates the filter parameter \(ids = 'P-001'\); \(2\) the agent invokes the custom action bound to the Parcel Details Flow; \(3\) the flow runs its Get Records node; \(4\) the flow invokes Prompt Builder, whose tags resolve against database values; \(5\) the flow populates the Output variable and Agentforce presents the natural language response.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
