/Title (Salesforce applies its Einstein Trust Layer to prompts sent through Prompt Builder, which includes protections such as masking of sensitive data and controls on how prompt data is retained by model providers. The exact behaviours depend on the org configuration and current platform release, so the administrator should confirm them in Salesforce documentation. Independently of the Trust Layer, SwiftShip Tracker limits risk through its design: the prompt receives a single record, the record is fetched under the running user's permissions, and the template forbids additional facts.)
